msgid ""
"Edit the menu structure as JSON. Each item can have: name, icon, command "
"(run through the shell) or action (a session action: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (array of items), "
"or separator (true)."
msgstr ""
"Editar la estructura del menú como JSON. Cada elemento puede tener: name, "
"icon, command (se ejecuta mediante el intérprete de órdenes) o action (una "
"acción de sesión: lock, logout, leave, switchUser, suspend, hibernate, "
"reboot, shutdown), submenu (vector de elementos) o separator (true)."

